Package: libmackie0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Mackie Control (MCU) codec for motorised MIDI control surfaces
 libmackie speaks Mackie Control (MCU), the MIDI protocol of motorised control
 surfaces such as the Behringer X-Touch: motor faders, buttons and their lamps,
 V-Pots and their LED rings, meters, the scribble strips and their backlights,
 the seven-segment displays, the jog wheel and the host-connection handshake.
 .
 It is a codec and nothing else: pure functions over byte buffers, with no MIDI
 port, no clock, no thread and no allocation.

Package: libmackie-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmackie0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Mackie Control (MCU) codec, development files
 Headers and the pkg-config file libmackie, for building programs that drive a
 Mackie Control surface.
